column 1 (index): index in file ncep_latlon.dat, between 0 and 286.
column 2 (i):     glsea 1024 arrary column shift to get water pix from land pix  
column 3 (j):     glsea 1024 arrary row    shift to get water pix from land pix  

in ncep_latlon.dat file, index 18, 131, 224 are point that are land pix in cw mask file, but are water pix in INC

